            <segments>CorrectMeasuringGoods</segments>
          </dataPath>
          <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
          <toolTipRepresentation>ShowBottom</toolTipRepresentation>
          <handlers>
            <event>OnChange</event>
            <name>CorrectMeasuringGoodsOnChange</name>
          </handlers>
          <extendedTooltip>
            <name>CorrectMeasuringGoodsExtendedTooltip</name>
            <id>374</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Discrepancies within the allowable deviation will be eliminated in the order lines with measured goods.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>مغایرت‌های در محدوده انحراف مجاز در سطرهای سفارش دارای کالاهای اندازه‌گیری‌شده رفع خواهند شد.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Nelle righe degli ordini con le merci di misurazione le discrepanze all'interno delle variazioni saranno eliminate.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>W wierszach zamówień z towarami wymiarowymi zostanie usunięte dopuszczalne odchylenie.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>В строках заказов с мерными товарами будут устранены расхождения в пределах допустимых отклонений.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Boyutlu ürünlerin bulunduğu sipariş satırlarındaki sapma dahilinde tutarsızlıklar düzeltilecektir.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Trong các dòng đặt hàng với hàng hóa đo được, sự khác biệt trong phạm vi dung sai sẽ được loại bỏ.</value>
            </title>
            <type>Label</type>
            <autoMaxHeight>true</autoMaxHeight>
            <extInfo xsi:type="form:LabelDecorationExtInfo">
              <horizontalAlign>Left</horizontalAlign>
            </extInfo>
          </extendedTooltip>
          <contextMenu>
            <name>CorrectMeasuringGoodsContextMenu</name>
            <id>373</id>
            <autoFill>true</autoFill>
          </contextMenu>
          <type>CheckBoxField</type>
          <editMode>Enter</editMode>
          <showInHeader>true</showInHeader>
