        <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
          <name>ProductsDivergenceOnTwoWayDecoration</name>
          <id>626</id>
          <title>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>Lines of orders for which the documents Vendor invoice and Warehouse receipt for different quantities are issued. Discrepancy correction is available in the workplace &lt;link InvoicesForRegistration>invoices for registration&lt;/>.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>سطرهای سفارش‌هایی که اسناد فاکتور تأمین‌کننده و رسید انبار برای مقادیر متفاوت صادر شده‌اند. اصلاح مغایرت در میز کار &lt;link InvoicesForRegistration>فاکتورها برای ثبت&lt;/> در دسترس است.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>Строки заказов, по которым оформлены документы Приобретение товаров и услуг и Поступление товаров на склад на разное количество. Исправление расхождения доступно в рабочем месте &lt;link InvoicesForRegistration>накладные к оформлению&lt;/>.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Satın alma faturası ve Ürünlerin Ambara Girişi belgelerinin düzenlendiği sipariş satırları farklı miktarlara sahiptir. Tutarsızlığın düzeltilmesi, düzenlenecek &lt;link InvoicesForRegistration>çalışma alanı irsaliyelerinde mevcuttur&lt;/>.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>Các dòng lệnh lập chứng từ Mua hàng hóa dịch vụ và Phiếu nhập kho với số lượng khác nhau. Hiệu chỉnh sai lệch có sẵn tại nơi làm việc &lt;link InvoicesForRegistration>hóa đơn cần lập&lt;/>.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>Lines of orders for which the documents Vendor invoice and Warehouse receipt for different quantities are issued. Discrepancy correction is available in the workplace &lt;link InvoicesForRegistration>invoices for registration&lt;/>.</value>
          </title>
          <title>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>Lines of orders for which the documents Vendor invoice and Warehouse receipt for different quantities are issued. Discrepancy correction is available in the workplace &lt;link InvoicesForRegistration>invoices for registration&lt;/>.</value>
